'''Super Smash Con 2019''' was a tournament held in Chantilly, Virginia from August 8-11, 2019. ''Super Smash Bros Ultimate'' was featured alongside ''Super Smash Bros 64'', ''Super Smash Bros Melee'', ''Super Smash Bros Brawl'', and ''Super Smash Bros for Wii U''.

